          <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-toggle"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We believe in treating adults like adults:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>No moral policing:</strong> We don't judge personal opinions or beliefs</li>
            <li><strong>Legal focus only:</strong> We only act on serious illegal activity</li>
            <li><strong>Self-regulation:</strong> The Vibe system lets users self-sort</li>
            <li><strong>No auto-bans:</strong> We don't automatically ban for cursing, weapons, or controversial topics</li>
          </ul>          <p>Our goal is free expression within legal boundaries.</p>
        </div>
