      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" onclick="toggleFAQ(this)">
          <span class="faq-question-icon">🚫</span>
          <span class="faq-question-text">How does blocking work on FreeYap?</span>
          <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-toggle"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Our blocking system prioritizes privacy while providing temporary protection:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Network-based:</strong> Blocks are tied to the user's current network connection, not personal identity</li>
            <li><strong>Privacy-first:</strong> We never store IP addresses - only one-way hashes for comparison</li>
            <li><strong>Temporary:</strong> Blocks automatically expire since IP addresses change over time</li>
            <li><strong>Limitations:</strong> VPN users may share blocks, and changing networks bypasses blocks</li>
          </ul>
          <p>This approach protects your privacy while providing reasonable protection from unwanted encounters. The system is designed to never collect or store identifying information about users.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

