            <li><strong>Check browser:</strong> Use Chrome, Firefox, or Safari (latest versions)</li>
            <li><strong>Restart browser:</strong> Close and reopen your browser</li>
            <li><strong>Check hardware:</strong> Ensure your camera/mic are working in other apps</li>
            <li><strong>Disable extensions:</strong> Some browser extensions can interfere</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Still having issues? Try refreshing the page or using a different browser.</p>
        </div>
