          <i class="fas fa-chevron-down faq-toggle"></i>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>If matching is slow:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Try fewer topics:</strong> Too many specific topics can limit matches</li>
            <li><strong>Use popular topics:</strong> Check the popular topics list on the homepage</li>
            <li><strong>Try different times:</strong> Peak hours have more users</li>
            <li><strong>Switch modes:</strong> Text chat typically has more users than video/voice</li>
            <li><strong>Go random:</strong> Remove all topics for fastest matching</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

