          <ul>
            <li><strong>Check internet:</strong> Ensure stable internet connection</li>
            <li><strong>Close other apps:</strong> Free up bandwidth</li>
            <li><strong>Move closer to router:</strong> Improve WiFi signal</li>
            <li><strong>Try different network:</strong> Switch between WiFi and mobile data</li>
            <li><strong>Firewall/VPN:</strong> Some networks block WebRTC connections</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

